---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Josh James | Systems & Platform Infrastructure">
    <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-12">
        
        <section class="space-y-4">
            <h1 class="text-[#34d399] font-mono text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight border-none p-0 m-0">
                Hi, I'm Josh.
            </h1>
            <p class="text-base text-[#cbd5e1] leading-relaxed">
                I'm a senior infrastructure and platform engineer with over twenty years of experience running large-scale networks, computing environments, and automated pipelines. I specialize in looking at messy, manual system bottlenecks and converting them into reliable, well-monitored infrastructure that scales predictably.
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#94a3b8] leading-relaxed">
                This site is a personal technical space where I break down the architecture of past enterprise platforms I've worked on, ongoing software ideas I'm testing, and sandbox experiments running inside my private hardware rack. 
            </p>
            <div class="bg-[#1e293b]/40 border border-[#334155] p-4 rounded text-xs text-[#94a3b8] font-mono">
                <span class="text-[#34d399] font-bold">Looking for your next engineering partner?</span> I love collaborating on hard scaling problems, zero-trust infrastructure, and automation systems. If you have a project or just want to swap technical ideas, please feel free to <a href="/contact" class="text-[#38bdf8] hover:underline">reach out to me directly</a>.
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-8">
            <div class="border-b border-[#334155] pb-2">
                <h2 class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[#64748b] font-bold m-0 p-0">
                    // Operational Updates & Engineering Deep Dives
                </h2>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-10">

                <article class="space-y-2 group">
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 font-mono text-xs">
                        <time datetime="2026-06" class="text-[#64748b]">June 2026</time>
                        <span class="text-[#38bdf8] bg-[#38bdf8]/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-semibold">
                            [Current Project Core]
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#cbd5e1] group-hover:text-[#34d399] transition-colors m-0 p-0">
                        <a href="/systems-architecture/webservice-monitor" class="text-inherit hover:underline">
                            Abstract Telemetry Fabric & Event-Driven Monitors
                        </a>
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-[#94a3b8] leading-relaxed">
                        An open-source, engine-agnostic log extraction framework driven by a single configuration matrix. Uses dynamic Terraform providers and Vector to intercept HTTP anomalies at the ingress tier before downstream analytics systems saturate.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-[#64748b]">
                        <span>#terraform</span> <span>#github-actions</span> <span>#vector</span> <span>#observability</span>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="space-y-2 group">
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 font-mono text-xs">
                        <time datetime="2026-04" class="text-[#64748b]">April 2026</time>
                        <span class="text-[#e879f9] bg-[#e879f9]/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-semibold">
                            [General Article / Idea]
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#cbd5e1] group-hover:text-[#34d399] transition-colors m-0 p-0">
                        <a href="/blog/agentic-ai-network" class="text-inherit hover:underline">
                            Building Resilient Compute Networks for Agentic AI Teams
                        </a>
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-[#94a3b8] leading-relaxed">
                        An analysis of specialized networking layouts needed to support local, coordinating AI models. Focuses on keeping processing times low, managing bandwidth consumption, and ensuring secure communication contexts between agents.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-[#64748b]">
                        <span>#ai-infrastructure</span> <span>#distributed-systems</span> <span>#networking</span>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="space-y-2 group">
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 font-mono text-xs">
                        <time datetime="2026-02" class="text-[#64748b]">February 2026</time>
                        <span class="text-[#34d399] bg-[#34d399]/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-semibold">
                            [Past Platform Architecture]
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#cbd5e1] group-hover:text-[#34d399] transition-colors m-0 p-0">
                        <a href="/systems-architecture/woolworths-ecom-scalability" class="text-inherit hover:underline">
                            Remediating High-Concurrency E-Commerce Checkouts
                        </a>
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-[#94a3b8] leading-relaxed">
                        A retrospective breakdown of a major cloud migration and performance optimization project. Reconstructed complex, fragile payment processing paths into scalable, decoupled systems capable of handling large transaction surges without backend database degradation.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-[#64748b]">
                        <span>#aws</span> <span>#remediation</span> <span>#kubernetes</span> <span>#high-scale</span>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="space-y-2 group">
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 font-mono text-xs">
                        <time datetime="2025-11" class="text-[#64748b]">November 2025</time>
                        <span class="text-[#38bdf8] bg-[#38bdf8]/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-semibold">
                            [Current Project Core]
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#cbd5e1] group-hover:text-[#34d399] transition-colors m-0 p-0">
                        <a href="/systems-architecture/monero-swap-engine" class="text-inherit hover:underline">
                            Distributed Saga Matching & Asset Swap Processing Nodes
                        </a>
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-[#94a3b8] leading-relaxed">
                        Designing a decentralized order-matching matrix that runs without a single coordinating point of failure. Implements atomic data tracking and independent micro-worker pools to guarantee processing reliability across distributed ledger endpoints.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-[#64748b]">
                        <span>#saga-pattern</span> <span>#monero</span> <span>#go</span> <span>#asynchronous-queues</span>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="space-y-2 group">
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 font-mono text-xs">
                        <time datetime="2025-08" class="text-[#64748b]">August 2025</time>
                        <span class="text-[#34d399] bg-[#34d399]/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-semibold">
                            [Past Platform Architecture]
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#cbd5e1] group-hover:text-[#34d399] transition-colors m-0 p-0">
                        <a href="/systems-architecture/secure-trade-commerce-system-with-ddos-protection" class="text-inherit hover:underline">
                            Isolating Perimeter Edges Against Distributed Traffic Inundation
                        </a>
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-[#94a3b8] leading-relaxed">
                        Re-architecting e-commerce request endpoints under active exploit stress. Built an external verification cluster coupled with strict container routing rules to block anomalous traffic scripts before reaching internal applications.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-[#64748b]">
                        <span>#security</span> <span>#ddos-mitigation</span> <span>#network-security</span> <span>#waf</span>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="space-y-2 group">
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 font-mono text-xs">
                        <time datetime="2025-05" class="text-[#64748b]">May 2025</time>
                        <span class="text-[#e879f9] bg-[#e879f9]/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-semibold">
                            [General Article / Idea]
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#cbd5e1] group-hover:text-[#34d399] transition-colors m-0 p-0">
                        <a href="/blog/foolproof-ai-detection" class="text-inherit hover:underline">
                            Algorithmic Drift and Constraints in AI Pattern Identification
                        </a>
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-[#94a3b8] leading-relaxed">
                        An inquiry examining the mechanics of text statistical metrics. Breaks down why standard data patterns render conventional AI code detection platforms unreliable over longer horizons.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-[#64748b]">
                        <span>#ai-research</span> <span>#data-science</span> <span>#pattern-analysis</span>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="space-y-2 group">
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 font-mono text-xs">
                        <time datetime="2025-03" class="text-[#64748b]">March 2025</time>
                        <span class="text-[#34d399] bg-[#34d399]/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-semibold">
                            [Past Platform Architecture]
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#cbd5e1] group-hover:text-[#34d399] transition-colors m-0 p-0">
                        <a href="/systems-architecture/skyramp-global-vpn" class="text-inherit hover:underline">
                            Orchestrating Highly Scalable Virtual Private Network Meshes
                        </a>
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-[#94a3b8] leading-relaxed">
                        Automating cloud network endpoints across multiple global regions. Built using optimized kernel configurations and infrastructure templates to maintain consistent data rates across complex connections.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-[#64748b]">
                        <span>#vpn-mesh</span> <span>#wireguard</span> <span>#global-networking</span> <span>#automation</span>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="space-y-2 group">
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 font-mono text-xs">
                        <time datetime="2024-12" class="text-[#64748b]">December 2024</time>
                        <span class="text-[#38bdf8] bg-[#38bdf8]/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-semibold">
                            [Current Project Core]
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#cbd5e1] group-hover:text-[#34d399] transition-colors m-0 p-0">
                        <a href="/systems-architecture/axiom" class="text-inherit hover:underline">
                            Axiom: Specialized Data Indexing Layers
                        </a>
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-[#94a3b8] leading-relaxed">
                        A personal software experiment exploring customized file indexing layouts. Developed to investigate low-overhead retrieval logic when working with highly fragmented structured datasets.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-[#64748b]">
                        <span>#systems-programming</span> <span>#database-design</span> <span>#storage-engines</span>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="space-y-2 group">
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 font-mono text-xs">
                        <time datetime="2024-09" class="text-[#64748b]">September 2024</time>
                        <span class="text-[#34d399] bg-[#34d399]/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-semibold">
                            [Past Platform Architecture]
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#cbd5e1] group-hover:text-[#34d399] transition-colors m-0 p-0">
                        <a href="/systems-architecture/vapefinder-platform-deep-dive" class="text-inherit hover:underline">
                            Spatial Indexing & Lookup Mechanics for Discovery Applications
                        </a>
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-[#94a3b8] leading-relaxed">
                        A project review of a location-based search application. Implemented geometric grouping matrices and caching structures to handle fast mobile search requests without exposing underlying database assets to scrapers.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-[#64748b]">
                        <span>#geolocation</span> <span>#spatial-indexing</span> <span>#nextjs</span> <span>#api-hardening</span>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="space-y-2 group">
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 font-mono text-xs">
                        <time datetime="2024-05" class="text-[#64748b]">May 2024</time>
                        <span class="text-[#38bdf8] bg-[#38bdf8]/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-semibold">
                            [Current Project Core]
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#cbd5e1] group-hover:text-[#34d399] transition-colors m-0 p-0">
                        <a href="/systems-architecture/autoplatform" class="text-inherit hover:underline">
                            AutoPlatform: Declarative Fleet Deployment Frameworks
                        </a>
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-[#94a3b8] leading-relaxed">
                        An internal automation stack developed to configure remote operating system footprints cleanly. Eliminates drift across distributed computing instances by verifying device matrices against a single declarative specification file.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-[#64748b]">
                        <span>#configuration-management</span> <span>#fleet-automation</span> <span>#linux</span>
                    </div>
                </article>

            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="pt-6 border-t border-[#334155] space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[#64748b] font-bold m-0 p-0">// Verified External Channels</h2>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-xs font-mono">
                <a href="/cv" class="flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-[#34d399] transition-colors">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/></svg>
                    <span>[Terminal CV]</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://github.com/joshjames" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-[#34d399] transition-colors">
                    <svg class="h-4 w-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 .297c-6.63 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.303 3.438 9.8 8.205 11.385.6.113.82-.258.82-.577 0-.285-.01-1.04-.015-2.04-3.338.724-4.042-1.61-4.042-1.61C4.422 18.07 3.633 17.7 3.633 17.7c-1.087-.744.084-.729.084-.729 1.205.084 1.838 1.236 1.838 1.236 1.07 1.835 2.809 1.305 3.495.998.108-.776.417-1.305.76-1.605-2.665-.3-5.466-1.332-5.466-5.93 0-1.31.465-2.38 1.235-3.22-.135-.303-.54-1.523.105-3.176 0 0 1.005-.322 3.3 1.23.96-.267 1.98-.399 3-.405 1.02.006 2.04.138 3 .405 2.28-1.552 3.285-1.23 3.285-1.23.645 1.653.24 2.873.12 3.176.765.84 1.23 1.91 1.23 3.22 0 4.61-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.92.42.36.81 1.096.81 2.22 0 1.606-.015 2.896-.015 3.286 0 .315.21.69.825.57C20.565 22.092 24 17.592 24 12.297c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12"/></svg>
                    <span>[GitHub Profile]</span>
                </a>
                <a href="http://au.linkedin.com/in/joshjsaunders" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-[#34d399] transition-colors">
                    <svg class="h-4 w-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/></svg>
                    <span>[LinkedIn Profile]</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/contact" class="flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-[#34d399] transition-colors">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
                    <span>[Secure Contact Page]</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

    </div>
</Layout>